### RBush

`src/index/rtree.mjs` is a derivative work of RBush, generalized from two fixed
axes to an arbitrary axis count decided at runtime. The R*-tree algorithms —
choose-subtree by least area enlargement, split-axis selection by minimum total
margin, split-index selection by minimum overlap, and bounding-box condensing on
removal — follow the RBush implementation.

